BUNDLED DATA

These are data corpora shipped for users to pick from, not code this product
executes:

  options/gitignore  270 templates generated from github/gitignore
                     (build/generate-gitignores.go fetches
                     https://api.github.com/repos/github/gitignore/tarball).
  options/license    28 licence texts, synced from GitHub's licence corpus by
                     upstream commit 42032fdecf (2017). These are the licence
                     texts themselves.
  modules/emoji      generated from rhysd/gemoji at commit 537ff2d7
                     (build/generate-emoji.go).

DEPENDENCY LICENCES

Go dependency licence texts are collected into assets/go-licenses.json
(1.2 MB) by build/generate-go-licenses.go and shipped with the binary;
`make go-licenses` regenerates it. JavaScript dependency licences are collected
at bundle time by rolldown-license-plugin. Neither is hand-maintained, so
neither is duplicated here.

DEVIATIONS

  - Module path renamed from code.gitea.io/gitea to github.com/hanzoai/git
    (cb8b07b268); the product is named "Git" and served as Hanzo Git.
  - Environment variables renamed GITEA_* -> GIT_* (962ab4f3bd).
  - User-facing Gitea branding, identifiers and the mascot removed
    (a655ad2b7f, 534814599f, d24e7ffd2b, cec850b847). Load-bearing upstream
    strings were kept where renaming them would change behaviour.
  - Forward-only: the .gitea directory, the gitea webhook type and the gitea_
    runtime keys were dropped (d47cdeb0fa).
  - Zero gitea.com dependencies (8c66b01570). The four go-chi middleware
    packages were vendored (5faa667de3, see above); the DingTalk webhook
    payload is defined in-tree instead of gitea.com/lunny/dingtalk_webhook
    (74133ba158).
  - Queue rewritten onto ZapDB as the durable backend; levelqueue, goleveldb
    and the nosql manager are gone (ab39c2f308, 973f62a6e4, 6ea26f854d), and
    ZapDB is reached through luxfi/database so the backend stays swappable
    (52cc17de28).
  - Routing: chi is the mux only; the route context is ours (f32cca4324,
    935f99f513).
  - Authentication is Hanzo IAM native.
